  "story": {
    "day": 163,
    "title": "Kaya's School Trip Memories",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya remembered her school trip.",
      "They took an airplane; her friend was absent.",
      "She did arts and crafts, not calligraphy.",
      "Kaya enjoyed hiking; a fox, mouse, monkey ran.",
      "A horse was quite nearby. Dolphin, octopus, rugby were popular.",
      "Tonight's important meal was pork curry.",
      "Kaya ate potato, onion, carrot, cabbage, mushroom.",
      "Also tomato, lettuce, seasoning, and sugar.",
      "Her neighbor enjoyed such a tasty steak.",
      "She had spaghetti and dessert; no sake.",
      "Kaya saw a public concert for a minute. \"Turn off!\"",
      "The answer? A million stars made her want to stay."
    ]
  }
